ranslations":["en","fr"],"cards":[{"overview":{},"type":"comment","size":"half","name":"Personal comment","content":"I feel like we have normalized too much `curl ... | sh` and one day we will regret it.\n\nThat's why I really like the permissions system in *deno*, but by laziness, most people just use `--allow-all` so it's kind of wasted.\n\nThis small project integrates perfectly with the `deno.jsonc` to extends the deno task runner with a lot of useful features.\n"}]},{"stub":true,"id":"denolithic","name":"*denolithic* · Markdown presenter\n","tags":["deno","typescript","app"],"created":"2021-05-19T00:00:00Z\n","language":"en","translations":["en","fr"],"cards":[{"overview":{},"type":"media","size":"half","name":"Overview","video":"@/medias/works/denolithic.mp4","poster":"@/medias/used/denolithic.jpg"}]},{"stub":true,"id":"distronaut","name":"*distronaut* · Distros ISO fetcher\n","tags":["systems","go","lib"],"created":"2022-11-04T00:00:00Z\n","language":"en","translations":["en","fr"],"cards":[{"overview":{"size":"half"},"type":"about","name":"About","content":"Automate the fetching of distributions installers across different repositories to monitor new releases or create a new aggregated ISO bank.\nIt is also able to connect with [*DistroWatch*](https://distrowatch.com) to collect metadata about distributions.\n\nWith the *distronaut* portal, distro-hopping has never been easier !\n"}]},{"stub":true,"id":"downtime","name":"*downtime* · Availability tracker\n","tags":["archived","github-action","systems","deno","typescript"],"created":"2020-12-12T00:00:00Z\n","language":"en","translations":["en","fr"],"cards":[{"overview":{"size":"half"},"type":"media","name":"Live demo","content":"<img alt=\"\" style=\"max-width:400px\" src=\"https://downtime.lecoq.io/status/google.com-443.svg\">\n<img alt=\"\" style=\"max-width:400px\" src=\"https://downtime.lecoq.io/status/unavailable.website.com-443.svg\">\n"}]},{"stub":true,"id":"esquie","name":"*esquie* · All-mighty autom