ful as [*puppet*](https://github.com/puppetlabs/puppet) by providing both declarative and imperative ways of configuring systems.\nAdditionally, the modules can be imported from anywhere thanks to the [ESM ecosystem](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/JavaScript/Guide/Modules) making it easy to add custom features and backward compatibility which is particularly useful in a corporate environment.\n\nThrough [`deno compile`](https://deno.land/manual/tools/compiler), plays can also be offered as a single executable binary.\n"}]},{"stub":true,"id":"jsdoc","name":"*Spotlight* · Documentation template\n","tags":["archived","javascript","documentation"],"created":"2017-07-07T00:00:00Z\n","language":"en","translations":["en","fr"],"cards":[{"overview":{},"type":"media","size":"half","name":"Overview","video":"@/medias/works/jsdoc.mp4","poster":"@/medias/used/jsdoc.jpg"}]},{"stub":true,"id":"jukendo","name":"*Montréal Jukendo & Tankendo Club* website\n","tags":["web"],"created":"2024-12-01T02:48:34.427Z\n","language":"en","translations":["en","fr"],"cards":[{"overview":{},"type":"media","size":"half","name":"Ippon!","video":"@/medias/misc/jukendo/ippon.mp4","poster":"@/medias/misc/jukendo/ippon.jpg"}]},{"stub":true,"id":"keywee","name":"*Keywee* · Smart keychain\n","tags":["archived","electronics","iot"],"created":"2017-06-30T00:00:00Z\n","language":"en","translations":["en","fr"],"cards":[{"overview":{},"type":"media","size":"half","name":"Overview","video":"@/medias/works/keywee.mp4","poster":"@/medias/used/keywee.jpg"}]},{"stub":true,"id":"language-theory","name":"Language theory","tags":["archived","c++","algorithms","parsing"],"created":"2017-10-19T00:00:00Z\n","language":"en","translations":["en","fr"],"cards":[{"overview":{"size":"half"},"type":"media","name":"Overview","video":"@/medias/works/language-theory.mp4","poster":"@/medias/used/language-theory.jpg"}]},{"stub":true,"id":"libs","name":"*libs* · Collection of minimalistic TS libraries\n","tags":["den